:: Carter House Leaving Early Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You stretch your arms into the air and simply turn towards the door when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> suddenly blurts out. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You’re not leaving yet, are you?”</span> He looks at you sadly as you give a nervous smile and apologize. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“B- but we hardly even hung out! Can’t you stay a little bit longer? Like, just long enough to play a little game or go on a little quest or…”</span> He sighs, knowing that begging won’t get him anywhere. <span style="Color: LightCoral">You apologize again as the boy slumps down on the couch.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Sad",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s fine. I was just hoping we’d get to spend more time together, is all.”</span> He sighs again, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright, you can go. BUT you have to come back soon and stay extra long to make up for lost time, got it?”</span> His smile returns as he jumps to his feet and points at you like he’s making a proclamation. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You owe me a full extra day of fun! Either here or in town.”</span> You laugh, not really agreeing, but not saying no either, since who knows what the future will hold. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> walks you out to the street, bidding you farewell. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Have a good rest of your day, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$CarterNickname</span>! I’ll see you in school!”</span> <span style="Color: Yellow">Despite his obvious disappointment at you having to leave, he does seem pretty happy to have gotten to spend any time with you.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Carter" -5>>
<br>
